<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Oregon</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across Oregon — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from Portland and the Willamette Valley to the booming high-desert market in Bend, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
