<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Oregon</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Oregon, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value for residential and builder work to handleless German luxury for high-end Portland and resort projects. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships. Oregon's market is led by Portland's strong remodel culture and a fast-growing Bend market, with steady demand in Eugene, Salem, and the coast.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry in Oregon</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and broad wood species; the versatile choice for Oregon's transitional and Pacific-Northwest-modern kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access modern construction — a strong fit for the clean PNW contemporary look.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for Oregon's residential and builder volume.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European kitchens for high-end Portland and resort homes, with protected dealer territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage to grow whole-home revenue.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="oregon-market-opportunity">The Oregon Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Oregon kitchens lean Pacific-Northwest modern: natural wood tones, warm neutrals, matte finishes, and a clean, understated aesthetic that pairs with the region's emphasis on natural materials and sustainability. Portland's remodel market favors transitional-to-modern work — two-tone schemes and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> construction — while Bend's growth brings mountain-modern warmth with <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh's</a> stain and paint program and handleless contemporary fronts at the high end. The mix of high-volume remodel demand and a rising luxury tier makes Oregon a strong market for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

